1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,650
Telefoning eskirmagan.

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:05,100
Balki faqat batareyasi charchagandir.

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:09,300
Usta, telefonim qotyapti, quvvati kechgacha yetmaydi.

4
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:11,330
Ikki yil bo'ldi, eskirdi.

5
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,940
Nasiyaga yangisini olaman!

6
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:17,700
Diyor, kim aytdi telefon eskirgani uchun qotayotganini?

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,560
Hamma biladi-ku!

8
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,560
Jim, Diyor. Qara.

9
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:28,220
Jeneva, 1924-yil, dekabr.

10
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:32,540
Dunyodagi eng katta lampochka zavodlari kelishib oldi:

11
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:37,240
oddiy lampochka ming soatdan ortiq yonmasin.

12
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:41,220
Undan oldin 2500 soatgacha yonardi.

13
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:44,560
Uzoqroq yonadiganini chiqargan zavod jarima to'lardi.

14
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,790
Ataylab-a?!

15
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:49,890
2017-yil.

16
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:55,920
Eng mashhur telefon kompaniyalaridan biri bir sirni tan oldi.

17
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:57,270
Qanaqa sir?

18
00:00:57,750 --> 00:01:01,790
Batareyasi eskirgan telefonlarni o'zi sekinlashtirib qo'ygan.

19
00:01:02,470 --> 00:01:04,250
To'satdan o'chib qolmasin deb.

20
00:01:04,850 --> 00:01:06,490
Lekin egasiga aytmagan.

21
00:01:06,970 --> 00:01:10,770
Odamlar «telefonim eskirdi» deb, yangisini sotib olgan.

22
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:14,420
Ko'pincha esa faqat batareyani almashtirish yetardi.

23
00:01:14,910 --> 00:01:20,160
Bu ochilgach, kompaniya Amerikada odamlarga yarim milliard dollargacha to'lashga rozi bo'ldi.

24
00:01:20,710 --> 00:01:23,640
Fransiyada 25 million yevro jarima oldi.

25
00:01:24,130 --> 00:01:26,700
Demak, mening telefonim ham eskirmagan,

26
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:29,580
shunchaki batareyasi charchagan bo'lishi mumkin?

27
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:31,470
Bo'lishi mumkin.

28
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:36,650
Kechir, eski do'stim... sen aybsiz ekansan!

29
00:01:36,940 --> 00:01:39,420
Quchoqlama, batareyasini tekshir!

30
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:42,450
Yangisini olishdan oldin uchta tekshiruv.

31
00:01:43,060 --> 00:01:44,950
Batareya holati necha foiz?

32
00:01:45,630 --> 00:01:47,140
Xotira to'lib qolmaganmi?

33
00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:49,880
Batareya almashtirish qancha turadi?

34
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:54,570
Ular senga telefon emas, «eskirding» degan tuyg'uni sotadi.

35
00:01:55,170 --> 00:01:57,850
Har gal so'ra: bundan kim foyda ko'radi?

36
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:02,040
Telefoningiz qotyaptimi? Botimizga modelini yozing:

37
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,900
@sahiychishopbot

38
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:07,470
Batareya holatini qayerdan ko'rishni

39
00:02:07,470 --> 00:02:11,040
va yangisini olishdan oldin nimani tekshirishni o'rgatadi.

